comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-22T07:15:23.785Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-22: searched all statuses for contracts output-budget recovery smaller than default, recovery_budget_multiplier, restore_with increase, and executable recovery obligations. Closed pm-h8tpeh owns the general executed-reference contract, open pm-f05lsg owns recovery-closure measurement, and open pm-5t33or owns output budgets; none records this monotonic-budget recurrence, so this issue is filed as their narrow defect child rather than a new programme."
  "2026-08-22T08:03:17.538Z","harness:codex","Implementation start 2026-08-22: coupled into the SDK boundary tranche after reproducing the live contracts receipt that recommends --output-budget 1200 after an effective 4500-token truncation. Scope is producer-independent monotonic recovery computation, executable CLI/SDK/MCP bindings, generated negative controls, and documentation."
  "2026-08-22T08:27:33.156Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence 2026-08-22: replaced the hard-coded 1200 retry with resolveReadOutputRecoveryBudget, derived from max(binding+1, measured pre-compaction cost), 25 percent safety margin, and 100-token rounding. Non-resumable CLI/SDK/MCP recovery bindings share the same strictly larger finite budget or explicit unbounded fallback. Focused recovery plus full read-output contract tests pass 33/33."
  "2026-08-22T10:34:13.678Z","harness:codex","Final evidence 2026-08-22: linked recovery tests passed 35/35; exact full coverage passed 7,759 tests at 100/100/100/100. Packed SDK consumption caught and fixed the missing public export, then proved a measured 100/260-token case recommends 400 and an unsafe integer case recommends explicit unbounded. CLI and MCP package paths also passed."
  "2026-08-22T10:52:32.986Z","harness:codex","Exact-head CI remediation 2026-08-22: PR #1088 run 32568168758 correctly blocked static quality because this terminal production defect lacked structured gate evidence. Added gate_strengthened evidence binding the former 1200-token negative control to the generated monotonic producer corpus and local/hosted static, coverage, and Windows gates; no waiver is used."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-22T10:34:14.431Z","harness:codex",A contract is not SDK-first until a clean installed consumer can import it from the published entrypoint; source-local usage and declaration snapshots alone can miss an unexported executable helper.
